Package: brmDE
Title: Mixed-Effect Modelling for Differential Gene Expression
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Stefano", "Mangiola", email = "mangiolastefano@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Mixed-effect modelling for differential gene expression
    analyses, based on Bayesian regression through brms. Fit, test, and
    adjust one gene at a time; a tidytargets pipeline composes estimate,
    hypothesis, and adjust onto the same targets graph.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
